{"title":"Weather","sourceTitle":"Weather/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Weather\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Weather (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Weather/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Tiempo (1% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Weather/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Météo (4% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Weather/it\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Clima (1% translated)\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\">italiano</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Weather/pl\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Pogoda (2% translated)\" lang=\"pl\" dir=\"ltr\">polski</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Weather/cs\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Počasí (20% translated)\" lang=\"cs\" dir=\"ltr\">čeština</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Weather/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Погода (4% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Weather/uk\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Погода (4% translated)\" lang=\"uk\" dir=\"ltr\">українська</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Weather/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"天气 (4% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Weather/ja\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"天候 (1% translated)\" lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">日本語</a></li></ul></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Weather-rain.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/0/07/Weather-rain.png/400px-Weather-rain.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"286\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/07/Weather-rain.png/600px-Weather-rain.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/07/Weather-rain.png/800px-Weather-rain.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1342\" data-file-height=\"958\" /></a><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Rainfall over a lake.</span></figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p><i>O clima não só parece bonito, mas também faz coisas.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p><b>Weather</b> é uma mecânica que causa inúmeros efeitos ambientais, como chuva, trovão e até granizo.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Clima\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Clima</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Técnico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Técnico</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Padrãos_climáticos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Padrãos climáticos</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Nuvens_e_neblina\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Nuvens e neblina</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Precipitação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Precipitação</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Eventos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Eventos</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Vento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vento</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Climate\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Clima\">Clima</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O clima é baseado na localização. Climas mais parecidos com selvas terão chuvas mais frequentes, enquanto aqueles que se assemelham a desertos terão menos chuvas. As diferenças nos climas podem ser visualizadas usando o <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Worldmap\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Worldmap\">mapa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Worldmap\" title=\"Worldmap\"> </a></span> do jogador. Em geral, as áreas que aparecem mais verdes são áreas de maior pluviosidade, enquanto as áreas que parecem mais castanhas são mais secas. E claro, as áreas brancas indicam regiões nevadas.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Mechanics\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span id=\"T.C3.A9cnico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Técnico\">Técnico</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>As áreas climáticas são definidas com algumas propriedades, pelas quais os padrões climáticos são afetados são a temperatura e a precipitação. Um padrão climático pode especificar uma função de peso que controla a verificação de onde um padrão pode se formar. <code>AvoidHotAndDry</code> ou <code>TestRainTemp</code> podem ser escolhidos, <code>TestRainTemp</code> requer que o padrão especifique intervalos para chuva e temperatura. Sem uma função de peso, um padrão pode ocorrer em qualquer clima. Os padrões também possuem uma propriedade <code>weight</code> que geralmente especifica a probabilidade de ocorrência de um padrão.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Weather stats can be viewed using the following commands:\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li><code>.weather</code> - Lists the top-right (“tl”), top-left (“tl”), bottom-left (“bl”), and bottom-right (“br”) regions and the player’s position along the linear interpolation. Stats include the current weather pattern, wind pattern, wind <i>speed</i>, and weather event.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><code>/wgen pos climate</code> - Lists the current temperature, climatic temperature, and climatic rainfall.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Weather&#95;features\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span id=\"Padr.C3.A3os_clim.C3.A1ticos\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Padrãos_climáticos\">Padrãos climáticos</span></h2>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Clouds\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Nuvens_e_neblina\">Nuvens e neblina</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Existem nove padrões climáticos básicos no jogo e várias outras variantes. Cada um tem formas de nuvens e precipitação associadas. No entanto, ainda existem apenas quatro atributos diferentes para um padrão climático: nuvens, neblina, precipitação e relâmpagos.<br />\nO clima pode ser influenciado pelos comandos do servidor, para mais informações consulte <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/List_of_server_commands\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/List of server commands\">Lista de comandos do servidor</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands\" title=\"List of server commands\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Type</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Weather pattern</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Allows precipitation</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Weight</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Altocumulus</span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Altocumulus clouds</span></td>\n<td>✔️</td>\n<td>1.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cirrocumulus</span>\n</td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cirrocumulus clouds</span></td>\n<td>✔️</td>\n<td>1.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cirrocumulus clouds with mist</span></td>\n<td>✔️</td>\n<td>0.33\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Clear sky</span>\n</td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Clear sky</span></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Clear sky extra chance in dry areas</span></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Clear sky with light sealevel mist</span></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>0.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cumulonimbus</span>\n</td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cumulonimbus clouds</span></td>\n<td>✔️</td>\n<td>1.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cumulonimbus clouds with rain</span></td>\n<td>✔️</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cumulonimbus clouds with rain and ceiling fog</span></td>\n<td>✔️</td>\n<td>0.33\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cumulus</span>\n</td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cumulus clouds and clear sky</span></td>\n<td>✔️</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Small cumulus clouds and clear sky</span></td>\n<td>✔️</td>\n<td>0.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Haze</span>\n</td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Rare strong haze</span></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>0.1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Medium haze everywhere</span></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>0.2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Medium haze extra chance for wet climates</span></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Overcast</span>\n</td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Overcast everywhere</span></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>0.75\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Overcast with undulating clouds everywhere</span></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Overcast extra chance in wet places</span></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>1.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Stratus</span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Light stratus clouds</span></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Existem várias formações de nuvens e aparências de névoa diferentes que podem aparecer no jogo. Todos eles são relativamente fiéis às formações da vida real nas quais se baseiam. Esses padrões podem ser alterados com os seguintes comandos:\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<ul><li><code>/weather setir [padrão]</code> - Define instantaneamente o clima para um padrão, apenas na região do jogador.</li>\n<li><code>/weather setirandom</code> - Define instantaneamente o clima para um padrão climático aleatório.<br /></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Precipitation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Precipita.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Precipitação\">Precipitação</span></h3>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Os padrões climáticos podem causar chuva, neve ou granizo. Para alguns padrões, a precipitação é controlada pelo clima, portanto, um local frio nevará enquanto um local quente choverá. Outros padrões sempre terão uma forma de precipitação.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Rain is replaced by snow when the temperature is below 4°C.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> When the temperature is below 0°C (or between 0°C and 1.5°C with ongoing snow), layers of snow will begin to gradually accumulate on the ground,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> up to a maximum of 3 layers (3/8th of a block).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O nível médio de precipitação no local em que o jogador se encontra pode ser verificado pressionando C - a precipitação média na área será exibida abaixo da temperatura externa, na janela de ambiente. Ele será exibido em palavras, que podem ser traduzidas em números para comparação:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Muito raro: 0 - 0,15 precipitação</li>\n<li>Raramente: 0,15 - 0,30 precipitação</li>\n<li>Incomum: 0,30 - 0,45 precipitação</li>\n<li>Comum: 0,45 - 0,70 precipitação</li>\n<li>Muito comum: 0,70 - 0,90 precipitação</li>\n<li>Quase o tempo todo: 0,90+ precipitação</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>The current precipitation can be changed using the following commands:\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li><code>/weather setprecip [-1..1]</code> - Overrides precipitation intensity and rain clouds. <code>-1</code> removes all rain clouds, <code>0</code> stops rain but keeps some rain clouds, and <code>1</code> causes the heaviest rain clouds. The server will remain indefinitely in that rain state until reset using <code>/weather setprecipa</code>. If no argument is included, returns the current override setting.</li>\n<li><code>/weather setprecipa</code> - Resets the override caused by <code>/weather setprecip</code> - Precipitation will be handled automatically.</li>\n<li><code>/whenwillitstopraining</code> - Tells when the rain should stop.</li>\n<li><code>/weather stoprain</code> - Stops any current rain by forwarding the simulation to a time in the future where there is no rain.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Events\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Eventos\">Eventos</span></h3>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Lightning\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Lightning\">Lightning</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>An event is an adverse weather condition involving lightning or hail. It occurs at the same time as a weather pattern.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Weather event</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Minimum temperature (°C)</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Minimum rainfall</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Weight</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">No event</span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">N/A</span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">N/A</span></td>\n<td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Light thunder</span></td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>0.2</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Heavy thunder</span></td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Small hail</span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">N/A</span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">N/A</span></td>\n<td>0.2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Large hail</span></td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>0.2\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p><b>Hail</b> causa dano aos jogadores que não se abrigam.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Há uma série de eventos específicos relacionados ao clima que podem ocorrer aleatoriamente ou ser alternados pelos seguintes comandos do servidor:\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<ul><li><code>/weather setev [event]</code> - Define um determinado evento climático globalmente.</li>\n<li><code>/weather setevr [evento]</code> - Defina um determinado evento climático apenas na região do jogador.<br /></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Wind\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vento\">Vento</span></h3>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Existem vários padrões de vento diferentes conhecidos no jogo:\n</p>\n<ul><li>ainda - Sem vento</li>\n<li>lightbreeze - Uma leve brisa</li>\n<li>mediumbreeze - Uma brisa média</li>\n<li>strongbreeze - Uma brisa forte</li>\n<li>tempestade - Tempestade forte como ventos</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Wind pattern</span>\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Base strength</span>\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Duration (hours)</span>\n</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Chance</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Minimum</span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Maximum</span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Minimum</span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Maximum</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Still</span></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0.05</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>22.7%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Light breeze</span></td>\n<td>0.10</td>\n<td>0.20</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>54\n</td>\n<td>22.7%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Medium breeze</span></td>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td>0.35</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>30\n</td>\n<td>22.7%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Strong breeze</span></td>\n<td>0.45</td>\n<td>0.75</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>42\n</td>\n<td>22.7%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Storm</span></td>\n<td>0.90</td>\n<td>1.10</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>9.1%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Wind-speed-plot.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/ec/Wind-speed-plot.png/180px-Wind-speed-plot.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"141\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ec/Wind-speed-plot.png/270px-Wind-speed-plot.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ec/Wind-speed-plot.png/360px-Wind-speed-plot.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1509\" /></a><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">The average wind speed at different Y-levels. From top to bottom: storm, strong breeze, medium breeze, and light breeze.</span></figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Existem diferentes intensidades e padrões de vento no jogo. O vento é mais relevante para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical_Power\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical Power\">potência mecânica</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mechanical_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mechanical Power\"> </a></span>, porque os moinhos de vento precisam de vento forte para funcionar. O padrão do vento pode ser alterado usando o seguinte comando:\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li>Starting from 10 blocks above sea level, wind speed receives a multiplicative bonus of 1% per block above sea level. The maximum wind speed is 1.5, or “150% wind speed.”</li>\n<li>For every block below sea level, wind speed falls drastically. At 4 blocks, speed is reduced by 50%. At 16 blocks, speed is reduced by 80%. The maximum wind speed reduction is 96.5%.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>If the current wind strength is 0, wind speed will be 0, regardless of elevation modifiers.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Wind speed is used by <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Windmill\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Windmill\">windmills</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Windmill\" title=\"Windmill\"> </a></span>, player-built structures that transform wind into <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical_power\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical power\">mechanical power</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mechanical_power\" title=\"Mechanical power\"> </a></span>. A windmill rotor’s <abbr title=\"The block info HUD, default Ctrl+B\">Block info HUD</abbr> displays wind speed expressed as a percentage (e.g., “Wind speed: 85%” or 0.85).<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>If the player is not inside an enclosed <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Room\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Room\">room</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Room\" title=\"Room\"> </a></span>, heavy winds will lower their <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature#Body_temperature\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">body temperature</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature#Body_temperature\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> In desert or snow environments, heavy winds generate sandstorms and snowstorms that reduce the player’s visibility and cause them to automatically cover their face with their right hand if empty. This action does not occur if the player has equipped <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Clothes#Face\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Clothes\">clothes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Clothes#Face\" title=\"Clothes\"> </a></span> in their face slot with the “eye protection” property, such as snow goggles.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<ul><li><code>/weather setw [padrão]</code> - Define o padrão de vento atual para o padrão de vento determinado.<br /><br /></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li><code>/weather setw [still|lightbreeze|mediumbreeze|strongbreeze|storm]</code> - Sets the current wind pattern to the given wind pattern.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n</div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r285111\">.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=col]{background-color:#5E462A;color:#EAD3B3;border:2px solid #382b1e;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history td{border:transparent}.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=row]{background-color:#D1B296;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n/**/+1) td{background-color:#CCBCAB}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n) td{background-color:#E0CFBB}</style>\n<strong class=\"error\"><span class=\"scribunto-error mw-scribunto-error-112edf4d\">Lua error in Module:History at line 30: attempt to index local &#39;version&#39; (a nil value).</span></strong><table class=\"wikitable history\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\">Versão\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Descrição\n</th></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li>In real life, the formation of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hail\">hail</a> favors warm surface temperatures because they promote strong updrafts and retain liquid water within clouds. These conditions are necessary for water droplets to accumulate ice and form hailstones.</li>\n<li>Snow accumulation and the freezing of water into ice blocks can be toggled through the <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/World_Configuration\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/World Configuration\">world configuration</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/World_Configuration\" title=\"World Configuration\"> </a></span> “Snow and ice,” or by using the command <code>/worldconfig snowAccum [true|false]</code>. Snow accumulation is enabled by default in all <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Preset_Playstyles\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Preset Playstyles\">preset playstyles</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Preset_Playstyles\" title=\"Preset Playstyles\"> </a></span> except for <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Creative\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Creative\">Creative</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Creative\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Creative\"> </a></span>. However, it does not currently appear to function as intended in other world types.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">Temperature</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/World_generation\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/World generation\">World generation</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/World_generation\" title=\"World generation\"> </a></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 837 of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vsessentialsmod/blob/0cd7da3e4f6e7faba7bcd7f56be4a9a144a1c088/Systems/Weather/WeatherCommands.cs#L837\">WeatherCommands.cs</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Lines 1379 to 1399 of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vsessentialsmod/blob/0cd7da3e4f6e7faba7bcd7f56be4a9a144a1c088/Systems/WorldGen/Standard/WgenCommands.cs#L1379\">Standard/WgenCommands.cs</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 24 of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vsessentialsmod/blob/0cd7da3e4f6e7faba7bcd7f56be4a9a144a1c088/Systems/Weather/WeatherDataSnapshot.cs#L24\">WeatherDataSnapshot.cs</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 258 of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vsessentialsmod/blob/0cd7da3e4f6e7faba7bcd7f56be4a9a144a1c088/Systems/Weather/WeatherSimulationRegion.cs#L258\">WeatherSimulationRegion.cs</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Lines 247 to 446 of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vsessentialsmod/blob/0cd7da3e4f6e7faba7bcd7f56be4a9a144a1c088/Systems/Weather/WeatherSimulationRegion.cs#L427\">WeatherSimulationRegion.cs</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 350 of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vssurvivalmod/blob/dfaeb44db824a7f37d5b7bf82ba0657633aa0f43/Systems/MechanicalPower/BlockEntityBehavior/BEBehaviorWindmillRotor.cs#L350\">BEBehaviorWindmillRotor.cs</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 274 of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vssurvivalmod/blob/dfaeb44db824a7f37d5b7bf82ba0657633aa0f43/Entity/Behavior/BehaviorBodyTemperature.cs#L274\">BehaviorBodyTemperature.cs</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-8\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Lines 948 to 973 in <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vsapi/blob/8321a7f3649fa576c86f11f80d3fd93e608385f2/Common/Entity/EntityPlayer.cs#L948\">EntityPlayer.cs</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  <